-<section class="company-hero"><div class="shell company-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT COMPANY LENS · SCAFFOLD</p><h1>MotherDuck</h1><p class="lead">A public non-fork canonical gateway donor provides two transferable MotherDuck mechanisms: a bounded query facade and structured connector health telemetry. Recruiter projection stays capability-led and makes no production deployment or affiliation claim.</p><div class="company-role-chips"><span>Applied AI Systems Engineer</span><span>Agent Infrastructure Engineer</span><span>Forward-Deployed Engineer</span><span>Platform / Reliability Engineer</span></div></div><aside class="card company-state-card"><span class="evidence-state scaffold">Scaffold</span><strong>0</strong><p>direct public evidence repositories</p><small>SEMANTIC_CAPABILITY_DONORS_ADMITTED_WITH_DEPLOYMENT_BOUNDARY</small><p><strong>Second depth:</strong> Mapped Only</p><small>claim ceiling · company_alignment_only</small></aside></div></section>
-<section class="section company-layer" id="recruiter"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>01 · RECRUITER</span><h2>What matters to this operating environment.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Alignment thesis</h3><p>A public non-fork canonical gateway donor provides two transferable MotherDuck mechanisms: a bounded query facade and structured connector health telemetry. Recruiter projection stays capability-led and makes no production deployment or affiliation claim.</p><p>No company-specific repository is currently admitted to the public recruiter surface. Transferable personal flagships may still be relevant, but they are not company adoption evidence.</p></article><article class="card boundary-card"><h3>Truth boundary</h3><p>Independent GlacierEQ work; no affiliation, endorsement, employment, proprietary access, or production deployment with the named target is claimed.</p><p><strong>Current public claim ceiling:</strong> company_alignment_only</p></article></div></div></section>
-<section class="section alt company-layer" id="master"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>02 · MASTER</span><h2>Innovation, architecture, and the governed second-depth gate.</h2></div><div class="company-two-col"><article class="card"><h3>Role-specific engineering frame</h3><p>The current dossier identifies the domain and public evidence subset without pretending that company-level bottlenecks have already been proven. Second depth advances only through pinned public evidence: role → externally supportable problem → inspected repository → bounded remedy → implementation receipt → reproduced proof → promoted claim.</p><h3>Current repository evidence</h3><p class="empty-state">No direct repository is recruiter-admitted yet. This is an engineering queue, not a reason to invent proof.</p></article><article class="card aspiration-card"><p class="eyebrow">SECOND-DEPTH STATE</p><h3>Mapped Only</h3><p><strong>Claim ceiling:</strong> company_alignment_only</p><h3>Blocking conditions</h3><ul class="evolution-list"><li>current_role_not_verified</li><li>company_problem_not_bounded</li><li>repository_code_not_inspected</li><li>proof_not_reproduced</li></ul><p><strong>Next gate:</strong> Verify a current public role or operating context before making any company-specific problem or implementation claim.</p></article></div></div></section>
-<section class="section company-layer" id="machine"><div class="shell"><div class="layer-heading"><span>03 · MACHINE</span><h2>Dense integration contract.</h2></div><div class="card machine-contract"><div class="machine-contract-head"><p>Compact wire view for agents and tooling. The structured record carries the same second-depth state and public-safe evidence references.</p><a class="button ghost small" href="record.json">record.json</a></div><pre>GEQ.CI/1 id=motherduck state=scaffold track=SEMANTIC_CAPABILITY_DONORS_ADMITTED_WITH_DEPLOYMENT_BOUNDARY
-ROLE[Applied AI Systems Engineer|Agent Infrastructure Engineer|Forward-Deployed Engineer|Platform / Reliability Engineer]
-REPO[∅]
-FLAGSHIP[job_app_helix|akos|doctor_strange|tower_of_babel|job_application]
