-<section class="hero-v21"><div class="shell hero-v21-grid"><div><div class="hero-kicker"><span>●</span> AVAILABLE FOR HIGH-LEVERAGE APPLIED AI WORK</div><p class="eyebrow">HONOLULU · SYSTEMS ARCHITECTURE · AGENT INFRASTRUCTURE</p><h1>I make powerful AI <em>dependable enough to use.</em></h1><p class="lead">I build the operating layer between model capability and dependable outcomes: explicit authority, deterministic coordination, controlled failure behavior, evidence that survives review, and artifacts another person or machine can actually use.</p><p class="hero-role">Forward-Deployed AI Architect · Principal Agentic Systems Architect · Principal AI Platform Architect</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#case-study">See the newest reproduced proof</a><a class="button secondary" href="/resume/">Open the résumé</a><a class="button ghost" href="/master/">Technical due diligence</a></div></div>
-<aside class="hero-proof-rail cockpit" aria-label="V21 proof cockpit"><div class="proof-rail-head"><span>Latest completed evidence path</span><b>REPRODUCED</b></div><div class="proof-star"><span class="star-index">01</span><p class="eyebrow">MISSION AGENTIC AI ASSURANCE</p><h2>Agent actions that earn execution.</h2><p>An independent reference gateway binds public evidence, policy, drift, replay safety, circuit breaking, and deterministic receipts before an action is allowed through.</p><div class="proof-star-state"><span>17 acceptance tests</span><span>proof bound</span><span>claim promoted</span></div></div><div class="proof-rail-metrics"><div class="proof-metric"><b>17/17</b><span>permanent implementation acceptance tests</span></div><div class="proof-metric"><b>1</b><span>company track promoted through reproduced proof</span></div><div class="proof-metric"><b>4328fa7</b><span>immutable implementation authority</span></div><div class="proof-metric"><b>b7a3e3c</b><span>reproduced proof receipt</span></div></div><p class="proof-rail-foot">Independent GlacierEQ reference implementation. No company adoption, deployment, affiliation, certification, classified access, or production-scale claim.</p></aside></div></section>
