-<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE 45-SECOND READ</p><h2>I turn ambiguity into systems that can be inspected, resumed, and trusted.</h2></div><p>The work is less about producing another AI demo and more about engineering the conditions under which capability becomes usable: ownership, authority, state, evidence, failure behavior, and completion.</p></div><div class="decision-grid bento"><article class="card decision-card feature"><p class="eyebrow">WHAT I ACTUALLY DO</p><h3>Build the operating layer around AI capability.</h3><p>I translate messy operational requirements into bounded technical systems, then carry them through implementation, verification, and a usable handoff.</p><div class="decision-list"><div class="decision-row"><span class="node">01</span><div><strong>Authority + contracts</strong><small>Who may act, on what, with which inputs, limits, and refusal states.</small></div><code>BOUND</code></div><div class="decision-row"><span class="node">02</span><div><strong>Deterministic coordination</strong><small>Ownership, idempotency, replay safety, budgets, dependencies, and state.</small></div><code>CONTROL</code></div><div class="decision-row"><span class="node">03</span><div><strong>Evidence + verification</strong><small>Receipts, provenance, tests, source identity, and truth-bounded promotion.</small></div><code>PROVE</code></div><div class="decision-row"><span class="node">04</span><div><strong>Human-machine surfaces</strong><small>One fact graph projected at the right depth for recruiters, engineers, and machines.</small></div><code>USE</code></div></div></article><article class="card decision-card"><p class="eyebrow">WHY THIS WORK IS DIFFERENT</p><h3>Completion is part of the architecture.</h3><p>A promising mechanism is not the same thing as a working system. I design for the real transition from build → test → use → defect discovery → repair → use again.</p><div class="pipeline" aria-label="Completion pipeline"><div class="pipe"><b>OBSERVE</b><span>actual state</span></div><div class="pipe"><b>BOUND</b><span>authority + limits</span></div><div class="pipe"><b>BUILD</b><span>narrow mechanism</span></div><div class="pipe"><b>VERIFY</b><span>claimed behavior</span></div><div class="pipe"><b>USE</b><span>real workflow</span></div></div><div class="claim-box"><strong>Operating discipline</strong><p>Preserve prior gains. Attack the governing blocker. Promote only what the evidence supports. Leave a system another person can continue without reconstructing the story.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
