-<section id="systems" class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">EXECUTED SYSTEMS · NOT REPOSITORY VOLUME</p><h2>Selected proof, ordered by what a reviewer can verify.</h2></div><p>The estate is an intelligence substrate. Public presentation stays compressed: promoted systems first, coherent suites second, full inventory only when the reviewer asks for depth.</p></div><div class="bento"><article class="card bento-card large"><span class="bento-index">01</span><h3>Mission Agentic AI Assurance</h3><p>Evidence-bound agent action gateway with deterministic receipts, policy and drift gates, replay safety, circuit breaking, and reproduced proof.</p><div class="micro-grid"><span>17 acceptance tests</span><span>REPRODUCED</span><span>PROOF_BOUND</span><span>content-bound evidence</span><span>idempotent replay</span><span>circuit breaker</span></div></article><article class="card bento-card medium"><span class="bento-index">02</span><h3>Portfolio Receipt Router</h3><p>An overstated autonomous-control surface rebuilt as a local fail-closed evidence router that preserves compatibility while refusing unsupported promotion.</p><span class="status verified">69/69 · 2 CI paths · 0 external actions</span></article><article class="card bento-card third"><span class="bento-index">03</span><h3>Job Application Helix</h3><p>Typed application-intelligence control plane connecting roles, repository evidence, public projections, proof state, and follow-up.</p><span class="status verified">148/148 recorded tests</span></article><article class="card bento-card third"><span class="bento-index">04</span><h3>Agent Coordinator</h3><p>Deterministic ownership, dependency, capacity, priority, and shared-token coordination.</p><span class="status verified">62/62 recorded tests</span></article><article class="card bento-card third"><span class="bento-index">05</span><h3>Bounded infrastructure family</h3><p>Cooling, energy, rack planning, security proposals, and nanofluid scenario models kept within their owning evidence boundaries.</p><span class="status verified">166 source tests + 19 memory tests</span></article></div></div></section>
-
-<section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE FACT GRAPH · FOUR PROJECTIONS</p><h2>Choose the review depth that matches the decision.</h2></div><p>The presentation changes. Identity, evidence state, uncertainty, authority, and explicit non-claims do not.</p></div><div class="layer-deck"><a href="/" data-index="01" aria-current="page"><p class="eyebrow">HUMAN COMPRESSION</p><b>Recruiter</b><span>Outcome, strongest proof, role fit, and fast human comprehension.</span><code>route /</code></a><a href="/master/" data-index="02"><p class="eyebrow">TECHNICAL DUE DILIGENCE</p><b>Master</b><span>Architecture, receipts, blockers, failure behavior, and exact limits.</span><code>route /master/</code></a><a href="/machine/" data-index="03"><p class="eyebrow">OPERATIONAL HANDSHAKE</p><b>Machine</b><span>Canonical structured facts and discover → connect → authenticate → call → verify → extend semantics.</span><code>route /machine/</code></a><a href="/mesh/" data-index="04"><p class="eyebrow">RELATIONAL SYSTEM</p><b>Mesh</b><span>Typed relationships across systems, evidence, company tracks, dependencies, provenance, and evolution.</span><code>route /mesh/</code></a></div></div></section>
