-<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT AND PINNED PROOF</p><h2>What the strongest receipts actually establish.</h2></div><p>Every number below is scoped to its exact repository or pinned revision. Nothing is allowed to borrow another system's evidence.</p></div><div class="master-grid"><article class="card master-card"><p class="eyebrow">AKOS · CURRENT HEAD</p><h3>Delegated execution identity survives to terminal verification.</h3><ul><li>Exact head: <code>eac3cab001306225b99da41c37370528331966dd</code>.</li><li>GitHub Actions succeeds across Python 3.11, 3.12, and 3.13.</li><li>Python 3.12: 200 collected, 199 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failures, 0 errors.</li><li>Caller, task, trace, executor, terminal state, verification result, and receipt hash are checked before acceptance.</li><li>160 broader preexisting Ruff findings remain explicit quality debt.</li></ul><p><strong>Ceiling:</strong> current-head repository CI, not production deployment, traffic, scale, third-party adoption, or repository-wide lint cleanliness.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><p class="eyebrow">ECHO · CURRENT HEAD</p><h3>Continuity without losing provenance or privacy boundaries.</h3><ul><li>Exact head: <code>6acdb3be1739f1659f3cec9f4b7d39d5799cd476</code>.</li><li>Merged privacy-boundary repair excludes case-specific/private identifiers from the public mesh.</li><li>Canonical hiring proof binds compile, correctness lint, dependency audit, 48/48 tests, and CLI verification.</li><li>Stable identity, idempotency, integrity, bounded retries, recovery, and execution receipts remain core invariants.</li></ul><p><strong>Ceiling:</strong> no production traffic/scale or publication of private/domain-specific systems.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><p class="eyebrow">TOWER OF BABEL</p><h3>Polyglot architecture where every technology earns its floor.</h3><ul><li>40 governed technology floors.</li><li>80 easy + advanced exhibits.</li><li>17 behavioral-proof floors.</li><li>3 formal-proof floors.</li><li>9 explicitly gated floors.</li></ul><p>Flagship composition: TypeScript ingress → Python planner → Rust authority → Go telemetry → SQL canonical state → WebAssembly sandbox → Lean proof → deterministic receipt.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><p class="eyebrow">PINNED CONTROL EVIDENCE</p><h3>Deterministic admission and guarded mutation.</h3><ul><li>Agent Coordinator: immutable historical 62/62 Python test receipt at its pinned executable revision.</li><li>Safety Monitor: 51 tests × Python 3.11/3.12/3.13 = 153 policy executions with zero failures/errors/skips.</li><li>Merge Authority: 26/26 mechanism tests + 38/38 gateway tests, expected-head guard, real GitHub-provider mutation, canonical readback, and replay suppression.</li></ul><p><strong>Ceiling:</strong> no generalized distributed exactly-once semantics, production reliability, or provider-scale claim.</p></article></div></div></section>
