-<section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEMS LINEAGE</p><h2>Biological systems → field systems → engineered systems.</h2></div><p>The architecture is not themed after biology after the fact. The systems vocabulary reflects a much older way of reasoning about interacting parts, boundaries, feedback, adaptation, and failure.</p></div><div class="master-grid"><article class="card master-card"><h3>Nested organization</h3><p>Biological scale → system / subsystem / component ownership.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Selective permeability</h3><p>Membranes → tool, data, privacy, and authority admission boundaries.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Signal response</h3><p>Receptors → connectors, events, typed inputs, and observability.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Homeostasis</h3><p>Stability → health checks, bounded recovery, known-good state, and rollback.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Adaptation</h3><p>Correction → policy → regression test → next operating cycle.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Structure / function</h3><p>A language, agent, or component earns its boundary through the responsibility it performs.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Morphometrics</h3><p>Observable features → measurable signals → defensible classification and evidence state.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Double helix</h3><p>Shared invariants across coordinated strands without collapsing their identities.</p></article></div></div></section>
-
-<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">ARCHITECTURAL CONSEQUENCE</p><h2>The metaphors have executable ownership boundaries.</h2></div></div><div class="master-grid"><article class="card master-card"><h3>AKOS + ECHO</h3><p><strong>Pillar + piston.</strong> AKOS governs identity, provenance, authority, maturity, and completion. ECHO carries continuity, idempotent work, recovery, and receipts through that policy boundary.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Colossal Agent</h3><p><strong>Biological decomposition.</strong> Nucleus/DNA/RNA/chromatin, organ systems, cells, receptors, membrane, and tissues. Its DNA layer uses paired strands joined by shared rungs.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Spiral Engine / Double Helix</h3><p><strong>Persistent iteration.</strong> Verified output becomes input to the next revolution instead of resetting to the same plane; coordinated strands retain identity while sharing invariants.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Job Application Helix</h3><p><strong>Hiring as governed system.</strong> Source repositories retain proof authority; Helix owns portfolio state; this public site renders audience-specific projections without changing the factual graph.</p></article></div></div></section>
-
-<section class="section alt"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">EDUCATION AS ARCHITECTURE LINEAGE</p><h2>The degree belongs in the technical story.</h2></div></div><div class="master-grid"><article class="card master-card"><h3>University of Hawaiʻi at Mānoa · B.S. Marine Biology · 2016</h3><p>Scientific training in interacting biological systems, ecology, physiology, experimental design, quantitative reasoning, field/lab investigation, evidence evaluation, and professional communication.</p><p>Morphometric research in 2016–2017 processed sea-urchin gill measurements to support visual species identification: an early version of converting complex observations into measurable signals and defensible classifications.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Compressed-gas systems · 2016–2017</h3><p>Tank filling, transport, inspection/repair support, and gas mixing under safety-critical procedures taught process discipline, state verification, and respect for failure consequences.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>Building systems · 2017–present</h3><p>Residential repair and inspection work developed practical judgment around interacting systems, uncertainty, defect consequences, sequencing, and decision-ready communication.</p></article><article class="card master-card"><h3>AWS Cloud Institute · 2025–2026</h3><p>Current Cloud Application Developer training extends that systems foundation into cloud application development, architecture, security, DevOps, data, labs, and capstone work.</p></article></div></div></section>
