-<section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">TIMESTAMPED ARCHITECTURE</p><h2>Chronology is useful only when the causal claim stays bounded.</h2></div></div><div class="callout"><p>Public GlacierEQ anchors include <strong>Pillars &amp; Pistons on March 16, 2026</strong> and a <strong>public Spiral Engine artifact on March 24, 2026</strong>. A later <strong>May 27, 2026 OpenAI public three-pillar/self-improvement comparator</strong> falls 72 and 64 days later, respectively.</p><p><strong>Classification:</strong> dated semantic convergence only. No access, copying, transmission, causation, or ownership of ordinary terminology is claimed.</p></div></div></section>
